sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant KubeAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as kuberay-operator<br/>Webhook 9443/TCP TLS
    participant Operator as kuberay-operator<br/>Controllers
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant HeadPod as Ray Head Pod<br/>8265/TCP
    participant Workers as Ray Worker Pods

    Note over User, Workers: Flow 1: RayCluster Creation

    User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply RayCluster CR<br/>Auth: Bearer token / kubeconfig
    KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated CR (defaults applied:<br/>EnableIngress=false, SecureTrustedNetwork=true)
    KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Validation response

    KubeAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: RayCluster created

    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create ServiceAccount, Roles, RoleBindings<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create self-signed Issuer + CA Certificate<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    CertMgr-->>Operator: CA provisioned
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create head + worker TLS Certificates<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    CertMgr-->>Operator: Certs provisioned (ca-secret, ray-head-secret, ray-worker-secret)

    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create NetworkPolicy for cluster<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create Head Pod + Service<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create Worker Pods<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    Operator->>KubeAPI: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar into Head Pod<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create OpenShift Route / HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS / SA token

    Note over User, Workers: Flow 2: Ray Dashboard Access (OpenShift)

    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    User->>Route: GET /dashboard<br/>HTTPS TLS
    Route->>RBACProxy: Forward request<br/>HTTPS TLS
    RBACProxy->>KubeAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    KubeAPI-->>RBACProxy: Auth result
    RBACProxy->>HeadPod: Forward to Ray dashboard<br/>HTTP 8265/TCP (localhost)
    HeadPod-->>RBACProxy: Dashboard response
    RBACProxy-->>Route: Authenticated response
    Route-->>User: Dashboard HTML
